@node Features
@chapter Features

@cindex Features


@itemize
@item
Automated export and view support for the following Org backends:
@itemize
@item
HTML
@item
Markdown
@item
ODT
@item
Texinfo
@item
@LaTeX{} PDF
@end itemize

@item
Export and view can be triggered via @code{save-buffer} or by a customizable key binding (default @code{C-<f5>}).

@item
Support for additional export formats can be done with customizable variables.

@item
Control @strong{Burnish} operation on a per Org file basis.
@end itemize

